{[%csl Gf7][%cal Ge6f7] Stalemate the black king} 1. Kf7 {Stalemate is a
situation where the player whose turn it is to move is not in check but has no
legal move to continue the game. The rules of chess provide that when
stalemate occurs, the game ends as a draw (i.e. having no winner).} *

